        "h": 3
      },
      "description": "",
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**One point per physiological cycle.** Charts include provisional values; see quality flags below. Missing values remain gaps. Weight is a separate observation recorded when the scraper fetched it.\n\nThe 9 AM Toronto job refreshes a rolling three-day window. This dashboard refreshes every five minutes; it does not trigger a scrape. Times display in America/Toronto, while reporting dates retain the timezone recorded by the scraper."
